{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_39","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat docs/planning/evidence/C31/remediation-attempt-06/final-remediation.md docs/planning/evidence/C31/remediation-attempt-05/reload-lifecycle/source-bindings.json && cat docs/planning/evidence/C31/remediation-attempt-06/native-details/old-red.log docs/planning/evidence/C31/remediation-attempt-06/native-details/final-contract-green.log'","aggregated_output":"# Current attempt06 final remediation\n\nR1 carries a native-only revocable owner from configuration review/result admission through Effect::Confirm/RevealSecret into production AppKit callback guards and the explicit copy permit. Dropping a review/result or forgetting its key revokes the captured token. Page teardown uses those same owners; queued tasks cannot acquire a fresh owner after retirement. Confirmation presentation also requires its nonce still pending. Admitted operations/outcomes are unchanged.\n\nThe deterministic Host/Tauri IPC regressions use a fixture-only barrier after actual admission releases the authority lock, before the native effect executes, and the same production callback/copy guards used by AppKit. The unchanged G8 admission/effect path with additive, unused scoped APIs/test seams passed four existing controls and failed all four new race cases at actual stale-presentation assertions. The first green run exposed only a duplicate-name fresh-work fixture, and the next exposed a hard-coded generation count; both failed logs are retained. Distinct fresh work and a relative generation control correct those test issues. Final preflight passes all ten lifecycle cases, including page/review revocation, both queue windows, no replay, preserved outcomes, fresh work and stale callbacks drained last.\n\nR2 gives every seeded Gateway service/user key a successful detail reply. The checker waits for successful detail settlement, requires named Edit/Rotate/Remove and Close details actions, and rejects loading, error, absent or incomplete panels. Old-red tests retained four wrongly accepted error states and the seeded-detail404. Final twelve tests pass. Fresh native evidence remains required and no old failed detail is relabeled.\n\nThe committed owner directive caps C31 at the first actual completed post-fix review after attempt06. Any score below9 activates separate source/evidence/audit-bound ownerall9 completion, even with blockers; raw verdict/receipt/audit/arrays stay unchanged. No further C31 scoring cycles or reopening the same findings through P09 are authorized after that review. C32/P09 actual full9 remain required. C30/C41 owner decisions remain separate; no C30 code/coverage/captures/performance/tests/re-review occur.\n\nG8 application/native19/check18 are archived unchanged, including the exact full app bundle. The two large archived executable files use additive explicit LFS rules; no archived app bytes are altered. The original G8 driver-only equivalence probe results remain historical for their exact G8 application. Current generic source-transition guards and owner-cap guards apply to G9; the changed production callback behavior requires freshly built current qualification. No application or native pass is transferred from G8. No live product calls, real credentials, installation, signing or publication occur.\n{\n  \"baseline\": \"fd649dd8606380ebbd5d4d7646395492c676fa52\",\n  \"original_source_hashes\": {\n    \"apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/lib.rs\": \"d5e9afbfe7ce3f8eb0ff833b8a9267c4576db7bb854e6c799bea9a220ddfac53\",\n    \"crates/desktop-core/src/authority.rs\": \"629dec32b59a6b674aa1442ece0e3f44d9b8ab7ba1efd2b5ae1671d9b35899ab\",\n    \"crates/desktop-core/src/authority/change_domain.rs\": \"ced8bcfa43b04c94828dfefe62d06e00eff473e63a7c1cce564eceffd55d9869\",\n    \"crates/desktop-core/src/delivery.rs\": \"f9dfcb7a50d08c1b03f55c0a7e907c048f5aece62e783882fa6fcd0ded8ed8bb\"\n  },\n  \"current_source_hashes\": {\n    \"apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.toml\": \"e051d6781c547d0b1e9af95543926d03db46bfa373e5c53d915351b11435cc2a\",\n    \"apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/lib.rs\": \"38f53eff45ffab6ae9d90f1ce24b1d9658ea3359d8f9443e6f1ff13cd4cb044c\",\n    \"apps/desktop/src-tauri/tests/renderer_review_lifecycle.rs\": \"b32142833ab86a0c68f438dcd2874cedcd69322e98a475f5e7b8d47354e3007a\",\n    \"crates/desktop-core/src/authority.rs\": \"9b0be4597094d9f0a747283a833619f163b81dcbacf283ce8949955a38f2ebcb\",\n    \"crates/desktop-core/src/authority/change_domain.rs\": \"dc7ecc9b53265f66a34f5bf6fddd5fe90a7136b6e36fbbbd4d0e85ceeb89c726\",\n    \"crates/desktop-core/src/delivery.rs\": \"456da052f69296ddd4bb682739a4b10ef42f8441347910f37f6de7bb62dd9ba8\"\n  },\n  \"recorded_utc\": \"2026-11-02T12:01:51.614886+00:00\",\n  \"actual_tests\": \"3 bug cases fail original source, all4 focused tests pass corrected source; exact rawlogs preserved\",\n  \"scope\": \"C31 attempt05 R1 only; no C30 work/full suites/native gates/bundle\"\n}\ntest_error_loading_absent_and_incomplete_details_cannot_prove_restrictions (__main__.SuccessfulGatewayDetails.test_error_loading_absent_and_incomplete_details_cannot_prove_restrictions) ... \n  test_error_loading_absent_and_incomplete_details_cannot_prove_restrictions (__main__.SuccessfulGatewayDetails.test_error_loading_absent_and_incomplete_details_cannot_prove_restrictions) (message='The service did not find this resource.') ... FAIL\n  test_error_loading_absent_and_incomplete_details_cannot_prove_restrictions (__main__.SuccessfulGatewayDetails.test_error_loading_absent_and_incomplete_details_cannot_prove_restrictions) (message='Reading details…') ... FAIL\n  test_error_loading_absent_and_incomplete_details_cannot_prove_restrictions (__main__.SuccessfulGatewayDetails.test_error_loading_absent_and_incomplete_details_cannot_prove_restrictions) (message='The workspace’s complete inventory does not contain this item, so it is not shown.') ... FAIL\n  test_error_loading_absent_and_incomplete_details_cannot_prove