{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_45","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat resources/harness/pin.json apps/desktop/academy-source.ts apps/desktop/src-tauri/capabilities/main.json apps/desktop/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json && sed -n '1,150p' docs/planning/status.md && sed -n '1,150p' docs/planning/WORF-START-HERE.md\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"archive\": \"resources/harness/darwin-arm64.tar.gz\",\n  \"archiveBytes\": 113497192,\n  \"archiveSha256\": \"10729706be0bf2ec2bae1d21155fe866b047960e73881583397887c083fce173\",\n  \"binarySha256\": \"383bcfb5f8d36d2367793a594ceeaf89a5c0fd618d6436397e9c2e22a682c1c5\",\n  \"engineCommit\": \"9331a5839bc6a763d94dee7584746f58bbbe1181\",\n  \"executable\": \"airs-harness\",\n  \"files\": 1618,\n  \"protocol\": \"airs-desktop/1\",\n  \"resourcesSha256\": \"1c0a1eb83c82ffe4b2dc22f8ec4c6bc6a61fecc326ca70969de9c14ca62b3ac4\",\n  \"runtimeVersion\": \"0.1.7-desktop.2\",\n  \"signing\": {\n    \"identity\": \"Developer ID Application: Calvin Remsburg (G5QLZ5A8TA)\",\n    \"options\": \"runtime\",\n    \"signedUtc\": \"2026-10-25T21:23:45Z\",\n    \"teamIdentifier\": \"G5QLZ5A8TA\",\n    \"timestamp\": true,\n    \"unsignedBinarySha256\": \"f8e49cee8b0905818c9271e91b2ca8f39b67075e602e5db7db683f9d37aee50c\"\n  },\n  \"source\": {\n    \"buildInfoSha256\": \"a22d963e7bedf212c3190ef78ebc4d885e99cac87e87a53ed297f694b692cbc6\",\n    \"v1Archive\": \"packaging/harness/darwin-arm64.tar.gz\",\n    \"v1ArchiveSha256\": \"e79f564a5210241488a49c4756ff061dff3d336e23709f5fb7adfd4bde0928aa\",\n    \"v1Commit\": \"74754c02b19d87187b6dca81f64550a669b0f841\"\n  },\n  \"version\": 1\n}\n/**\n * Academy learner source compiled into the desktop (C05). The learner\n * package (@ai-security-academy/learner) exports Academy's own pages; their\n * `@/` imports are Academy's source in the prepared, hash-verified input\n * (.work/academy, xtask shared-prepare). Every bare import that source makes\n * resolves to this app's pinned copy (`dedupe`), so one React, one React\n * Query and one router instance exist and versions follow the desktop lock.\n */\n// A file-system path without Node typings in the app's tsconfig (the\n// repository path has no characters that URL-encode other than these).\nexport const ACADEMY_SRC = decodeURIComponent(new URL('../../.work/academy/src', import.meta.url).pathname)\nconst CONTRACTS_ROOT = decodeURIComponent(new URL('../../packages/desktop-contracts/', import.meta.url).pathname)\n\n// node_modules may be shared with another worktree. Compile this checkout's IPC parser and bindings,\n// not the workspace package reached through that other checkout's dependency symlink.\nexport const desktopAliases = [\n    { find: /^@prisma-airs\\/desktop-contracts$/, replacement: `${CONTRACTS_ROOT}src/index.ts` },\n    { find: /^@prisma-airs\\/desktop-contracts\\/fixtures\\//, replacement: `${CONTRACTS_ROOT}fixtures/` },\n    { find: /^@\\//, replacement: `${ACADEMY_SRC}/` },\n]\n\nexport const academyDedupe = [\n    'react',\n    'react-dom',\n    '@ai-security-academy/presentation',\n    '@ai-security-academy/shared',\n    '@codemirror/commands',\n    '@codemirror/lang-python',\n    '@codemirror/lang-yaml',\n    '@codemirror/language',\n    '@codemirror/state',\n    '@codemirror/view',\n    '@dnd-kit/core',\n    '@excalidraw/excalidraw',\n    '@lezer/highlight',\n    '@radix-ui/react-dialog',\n    '@radix-ui/react-slot',\n    '@tanstack/react-query',\n    '@tanstack/react-router',\n    '@trpc/client',\n    '@trpc/react-query',\n    '@trpc/server',\n    'class-variance-authority',\n    'clsx',\n    'dompurify',\n    'lucide-react',\n    'mermaid',\n    'qrcode.react',\n    'sanitize-html',\n    'tailwind-merge',\n    'zustand',\n]\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json\",\n  \"identifier\": \"main-window\",\n  \"description\": \"The packaged main window may call only the two application commands.\",\n  \"local\": true,\n  \"windows\": [\"main\"],\n  \"webviews\": [\"main\"],\n  \"permissions\": [\"allow-desktop-dispatch\", \"allow-desktop-observe\"]\n}\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://schema.tauri.app/config/2\",\n  \"productName\": \"Prisma AIRS Desktop v2\",\n  \"version\": \"2.0.0\",\n  \"identifier\": \"io.cdot.prisma-airs-desktop.v2\",\n  \"build\": {\n    \"frontendDist\": \"../dist\",\n    \"beforeBuildCommand\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"app\": {\n    \"withGlobalTauri\": false,\n    \"windows\": [],\n    \"security\": {\n      \"csp\": {\n        \"default-src\": \"'self'\",\n        \"script-src\": \"'self'\",\n        \"style-src\": \"'self'\",\n        \"img-src\": \"'self' data:\",\n        \"font-src\": \"'self' data:\",\n        \"connect-src\": \"ipc: http://ipc.localhost\",\n        \"object-src\": \"'none'\",\n        \"base-uri\": \"'none'\",\n        \"form-action\": \"'none'\",\n        \"frame-ancestors\": \"'none'\",\n        \"frame-src\": \"'none'\",\n        \"worker-src\": \"'none'\"\n      },\n      \"dangerousDisableAssetCspModification\": false,\n      \"freezePrototype\": true,\n      \"capabilities\": [\"main-window\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"bundle\": {\n    \"active\": true,\n    \"targets\": [\"app\", \"dmg\"],\n    \"category\": \"DeveloperTool\",\n    \"copyright\": \"Copyright 2026 cdot\",\n    \"license\": \"Apache-2.0\",\n    \"icon\": [\"icons/32x32.png\", \"icons/128x128.png\", \"icons/128x128@2x.png\", \"icons/icon.icns\", \"icons/icon.png\"],\n    \"macOS\": {\n      \"minimumSystemVersion\": \"13.0\",\n      \"hardenedRuntime\": true\n    }\n  }\n}\n# Current state\n\nG00 and G01 passed (historical Claude reviews). C01–C04 and the P01 cumulative review completed on\n2026-10-17; C05–C07 and the P02 cumulative review completed on 2026-10-18;\nC08–C12 and the P03 cumulative review completed on 2026-10-19; C13–C15 and\nthe P04 cumulative review completed on 2026-10-20; C16–C18 and the P05\ncumulative review completed on 2026-10-21; C19–C22 and the P06 cumulative\nreview completed on 2026-10-23; C23–C24 and the P07 cumulative review\ncompleted on 2026-10-24. P08/C26 remains open; the owner-authorized P09\nintegration is now at fresh Worf cumulative native qualification after C44 full-9 closure.\nWorf native generation 01 passed all 19 mapped drivers with C44 last, including\nC43's 24 behaviors and 48 rows. It is preserved complete with the exact executable\nunder `evidence/P09/native-history/Worf-generation-01-complete-20261101`.\nFresh check attempt-03 passed 17/18 checks but failed import test relaunch/timing\nassertions on all three fixture runs. The corrected harness uses the production\nshutdown hook, a durable receipt boundary and a read-only fixture observer of the\narmed cut; the full import suite now passes 23/23 with every assertion retained.\nNative generation 02 is rebuilt with an exact before/after input seal; C36 passed,\nand all remaining mapped drivers will repeat before\nfresh checks and C29–C32/P09 reviews. C24-N06 and C31-N01/N04 remain superseded raw\nfailures under the unchanged map. No current native or review pass is transferred\nto changed inputs.\nUse [WORF-START-HERE](WORF-START-HERE.md) for the 2026-11-01 checkpoint and next commands. D026 (2026-10-17) makes Codex the independent reviewer of every chunk\nand of a cumulative review after every phase, each requiring at least 9 in all\nfive dimensions with empty required fixes, blockers and evidence gaps. D034 (2026-10-18, owner rule) lets a chunk complete at 8/10 with no\nblockers; each phase review still needs 9/10, after every chunk accepted below\n9 is raised to a passing review.\n\n| Gate/chunk | State | Evidence/next action |\n|---|---|---|\n| G00 | Passed (historical) | Attempt03 scored 9 in all five dimensions |\n| G01 | Passed (historical) | Attempt05 scored 9 in all five dimensions; fingerprint covers commit 931916b inputs only |\n| C01 | **Complete** (generation 1): Codex attempt-04 scored 9 in all five dimensions; bootstrap agreement passed (52 adversarial cases including 16 typed, 2 controls); committed as ce5bd8d and verified against the reviewed source fingerprint | Attempts 01–03 failed and were remediated (records retained) |\n| C02 | **Complete** (generation 1): Codex attempt-03 scored 9 in all five dimensions; committed as dfcf9bb and verified against the reviewed source fingerprint | Attempts 01–02 failed and were remediated (records retained) |\n| C03 | **Complete** (generation 1): Codex attempt-02 scored 9 in all five dimensions; committed as 1b69852 and verified against the reviewed source fingerprint | Attempt-01 (9/8/8/8/8) remediated (`reviews/C03/remediation-attempt-01.md`); budgets v3 acknowledged; C24 owns the typed-input memory observation |\n| P01 | **Complete**: Codex phase attempt-02 scored 9 in all five dimensions; committed as 80d6c51 and verified against the reviewed source fingerprint | Attempt-01 (9/8/9/8/8) remediated (`reviews/P01/remediation-attempt-01.md`); 38/38 integrated native checks; budgets re-measured on the P01 bundle |\n| C04 | **Complete** (generation 1): Codex attempt-03 scored 9 in all five dimensions; committed as 4c13792 and verified against the reviewed source fingerprint | Attempts 01 (8/7/7/8/7) and 02 (9/8/9/8/8) remediated (`reviews/C04/remediation-attempt-0{1,2}.md`); D028 recorded |\n| C05 | **Complete** (generation 1): Codex attempt-03 passed; committed as 7afdd9b and verified against the reviewed source fingerprint | Attempts 01–02 remediated (`reviews/C05/remediation-attempt-0{1,2}.md`) |\n| C06 | **Complete** (generation 1): Codex attempt-05 passed; committed as 8718ac9 and verified against the reviewed source fingerprint | Attempts 01–04 remediated (records retained); D030 recorded |\n| C07 | **Complete** (generation 1): Codex attempt-06 scored 9 in all five dimensions; committed as 960e340 and verified against the reviewed source fingerprint | Attempts 01–05 remediated (`reviews/C07/remediation-attempt-0{1..5}.md`); D031 and D032 recorded |\n| P02 | **Complete**: Codex phase attempt-